// HybridConnectionManager Service Installation - Registry | T1608 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/registry/registry_event/registry_event_hybridconnectionmgr_svc_installation.yml
DeviceRegistryEvents
| where RegistryKey contains "\\Services\\HybridConnectionManager" or (ActionType =~ "RegistryValueSet" and RegistryValueData contains "Microsoft.HybridConnectionManager.Listener.exe")
